	(text "Unpowered tool: its ID resistor to GND against R957, read on\nGP26 (ADC0): open = no tool, ~0 = passive, mid = power it.\nLater the same pin is the tool's half-duplex link (PIO), with\nR958 as the strong pull-up from GP27 (driven high only then).\nNo big cap here: it is the data line too."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 190.5 121.92 0)
		(effects
