	(text "GP6 high = the NPN conducts = the Melzi pin low = OK. A touch, a dead\nMCU (100k holds the base low) or a cut wire: the Melzi's pull-up\n(R401, sheet Melzi) wins = triggered."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 317.5 157.48 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "fc9f0621-f203-4877-8507-053e134ccf96")
	)
	(text "POWER"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 22.86 190.5 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "23edcf23-2792-4257-a1d7-f23bdea2ddca")
	)
	(text "The board: USB from the Pi (its 3V3 = +3V3_PH, the bridge's E+).\nThe tool: MP_Buck1 (+5V_BUCK1) through U953 and F951 to\n+5V_TOOL. Grounds: the one star point; R960 on the CTRL line."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 22.86 195.58 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "a29d17f9-ebc9-4c48-a134-a539f37d0218")
	)
	(text "THE BRIDGE"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 110.49 190.5 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "0fb1f628-3806-41bc-a1fd-e4c82d29f9d2")
	)
	(text "One full bridge, closed on the pads on HS: orange = E, blue = S.\nGreen: the tool's ID, brown: an LED. Sign and grams on the bench.\nCheck diag() noise with the LED toggling and an ID read running."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 110.49 195.58 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "6e606f05-49bb-4de0-9099-4cc7ad80454a")
	)
	(text "THE ADC"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 198.12 190.5 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "a3c8acfd-190c-4134-91f2-0485b16a009b")
	)
	(text "The plot bed board's sum chip: AIN0-AIN1, 330/s, DRDY2 = the touch IRQ.\nRatiometric: REFP0/REFN0 on the 3V3 that feeds E+.\nThe feet chip (CS1/DRDY1) is not fitted: firmware reports it missing."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 198.12 195.58 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "11f280f1-b15b-466d-8683-5bac226c2eee")
	)
	(text "THE TOOL"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 288.29 190.5 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "f0e884b7-ca1f-407d-b005-88a770d96e03")
	)
	(text "GP26: the ID (later the link), GP27: its pull-up, GP9:\nthe tool's 5 V, GP2: the LED. Data pins inputs until the\ntool has 5 V. Klipper keeps K and its lock switch (Melzi)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 288.29 195.58 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "811a996f-554a-4a33-942d-5c53483323b8")
	)
